		(property "NOTE" "B2B-PH-SM4-TB(LF)(SN): 8 mm tall, wire leaves upward; the side-entry twin is S2B-PH-SM4-TB(LF)(SN) (5.5 mm). There is no polarity standard for JST-PH LiPo packs: check pin 1 = + against the pack before plugging in. Footprint JST-B2B-PH-SM4-TB to draw from the catalog page (two contact pads on 2.0 mm plus two 1.6 x 3.0 mm fixing pads). Digi-Key 57,541 in stock at $0.47 on 2026-09-09."
